{"id":"d9d9a691a7b0cc03","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-formula.md","title":"公式","display":"df-formula — 公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-formula","aliases":["28-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — 公式","depends_on":["[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","[[28-df-atomic-formula]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — 公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34fa28c2966187ff\" href=\"?note=34fa28c2966187ff\" title=\"28-df-atomic-formula\">28-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-formula-—-公式-$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$\">df-formula — 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(S,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"34fa28c2966187ff\" href=\"?note=34fa28c2966187ff\" title=\"28-df-atomic-formula\">28-df-atomic-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall,\\exists\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall,\\exists\\)</span> 为互异的有限有序树构造子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}F_{m+1}\\coloneqq F_m&amp;\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in F_m\\}\\\\&amp;\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_m\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\\\&amp;\\cup\\{Qx\\,\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in F_m\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_m.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}F_{m+1}\\coloneqq F_m&amp;\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in F_m\\}\\\\&amp;\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_m\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\\\&amp;\\cup\\{Qx\\,\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in F_m\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_m.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用集合上的逐层构造替代对未给定论域的“所有闭合集”的类交。保留全部原有联结词，包括双条件，供满足关系完整递归。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-formula-—-公式-$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$","text":"df-formula — 公式 $\\mathrm{Fml}_S$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"34fa28c2966187ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}$ 来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]，$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 来自 [[28-df-atomic-formula]]。$\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall,\\exists$ 为互异的有限有序树构造子。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"34fa28c2966187ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}$ 来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]，$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 来自 [[28-df-atomic-formula]]。$\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall,\\exists$ 为互异的有限有序树构造子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S,\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}F_{m+1}\\coloneqq F_m&\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in F_m\\}\\\\&\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_m\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\\\&\\cup\\{Qx\\,\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in F_m\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_m.\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1249,"backlinks":[{"id":"33292a1a991cbb70","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 的常元为 $0$，一元函数为 $S$，二元函数为 $+,\\times$，二元关系为 $<$；标准结构为 $\\mathfrak N=(\\mathbb N,0,S,+,\\times,<)$。语法、满足与自由变量来自 [[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]、[[28-df-free-variable]]。$\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}$ 来自 [[28-df-atomic-formula]]；$\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{var}$ 来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N)$ 来自 [[28-df-assignment]]。\n$\\exists x<t\\,\\psi$、$\\forall x<t\\,\\psi$ 为下式构造的有界量词语法缩写，$x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t)$；$\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\psi$ 为下式定义的标准模型等价关系。$\\bar x$ 为非空有限变量列。"},{"id":"576c295ee467e0a8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}$ 与有限语法树来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]；$\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 来自 [[28-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Sf},\\mathrm{BV}$ 在公式树上递归。"},{"id":"42bd57d799b5867e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5167b1e044a694ca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S$ (公式, see [[28-df-formula]])"},{"id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是有效编码的有限签名；$\\mathrm{Expr}_S=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S$，see [[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]。\n$\\operatorname{ser}_S:\\mathrm{Expr}_S\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是带构造标签、元数和变量索引的可计算前缀树序列化，配有可计算部分逆 $\\operatorname{parse}_S$；域为 $\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_S)$，且该域可判定。$\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}:\\mathrm{TM}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是固定单射，采用有限转移表、状态与字母的自分隔列表编码，机器表示的编码、解码与有效性检查均为多项式时间，码长与所列转移表长度彼此多项式有界；元层编码机制固定于此。\n$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$u,v\\in\\Sigma^*$，$\\epsilon$ 为空串，$b_0\\cdots b_{m-1}\\in\\Sigma^m$；$k,m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{pair}_G$、$\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}$ 由下式定义；$\\langle u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)$ 仅用于元数 $k$ 由调用签名固定的元组，$u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\in\\Sigma^*$。元数作为调用签名的已知参数，不从码串中恢复；各固定元数分别满足单射性。"},{"id":"8aa5997eb451f824","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 采用 [[28-df-formula]] 的一阶语法；$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$。以下按有限公式树结构递归。"},{"id":"d82c10f45e77e524","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)=A^{\\mathrm{Var}}$，$\\beta[a/x]$ 见 [[28-df-assignment]]；$\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[28-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"410d75338bdb9bb0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ (公式集, see [[28-df-formula]])"},{"id":"30782c151faede34","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma, \\Delta \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S$ (公式集, see [[28-df-formula]])"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语法与语义：[[28-df-atomic-formula]]、[[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-free-variable]]、[[28-df-bound-variable]]、[[28-df-sentence]]、[[28-df-assignment]]、[[28-df-structure]]、[[28-df-term-interpretation]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]。"}],"outgoing":["acf90b9de82eb78c","34fa28c2966187ff"]}